# Enterprise Threat Detection Strategy

## Executive Summary

Designed an enterprise threat detection and monitoring strategy for Unidad Web, a cloud services provider supporting more than 5,000 customers. The strategy uses layered security monitoring across Windows, Linux, UNIX, cloud services, and network infrastructure to improve threat visibility, accelerate incident detection, and reduce organizational risk. 【1-9a6e2a】

